  "text": "My issues 3 My sessions 1 Dashboard Development Issues Projects Knowledge Project memory Releases Releases Hosted environments Agent management Agents Runtimes Skills Usage Settings NocoBase Studio v1.0.0-beta.75 Skills Demo mode · Switch account 3 SA Skills Reusable instructions with supporting files. Attach team defaults globally or to a project or working directory. Import New skill Name Description Files Version Updated code-review What the team looks for in a code review, and how review comments are written. 0 v1 11 hours ago commit-messages Conventions for Git commit messages and pull request titles (Conventional Commits). 0 v1 11 hours ago frontend-components Conventions for React components, styling and translations. 0 v1 11 hours ago quality-plan Discuss the business objective and scope, present a structured quality plan, then create and start its native work after one user confirmation. 2 v5 last week quality-report Deliver readable function-oriented quality reports with truthful outcomes and registered follow-up work. 0 v5 2 weeks ago quality-task Execute a confirmed quality plan through native testing tasks, real observations and linked follow-up work. 5 v6 last week studio-approach How to write an approach (a design proposal) for a step of this project. Read it whenever you are asked for an approach, a design, a plan or a short proposal before implementation, and when you review one. 0 v2 2 weeks ago studio-comment-style How to write comments and attached documents on NocoBase Studio issues. Read it before you post any comment on an issue — a step's reply, a hand-over, a question or a delivery report — or attach a document such as an approach, a review or a verification record, and follow it. 0 v3 11 hours ago studio-development This project's development standard for agents doing a step — how to work on a step, design, verify, handle CI failures, review and deliver. Read it at the start of every step you are handed on an issue of this project. 0 v5 11 hours ago studio-review How to review a pull request on an issue of this project — what to look at (defects, security, design and simplicity, tests and their CI cost), how to grade findings, what blocks a merge and how to write the verdict. Read it whenever you are handed a review step. 0 v3 11 hours ago studio-workflow This project's development workflow for the project manager — how to split an issue into steps, which agent gets each step (design, implementation, review, CI), when an approach comes first, how reviews and rounds work and when work is ready to deliver. The project manager reads it before handing out any step. 0 v5 11 hours ago This is a demo. Changes cannot be saved. Everything else works as usual.",
